 Color is just right for the primeval soup.

8
00:02:12,420 --> 00:02:14,240
 Our friends Metro and Mysra dig that soup.

9
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:26,680
 Rather crudely put, I'd say, but quite right, the color seems to indicate the balance of elements, carbon, hydrogen, oxygen, and nitrogen, precisely what is needed for the creation of amino acids, which are, as you know, the origin of all life.

10
00:02:27,730 --> 00:02:29,680
 In that case, let's take a closer look.

11
00:02:30,050 --> 00:02:33,410
 Oh, with pleasure. It'll be certainly more interesting than this tiresome ship.

12
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:35,740
 No, Pierrot, I don't think we should go there.

13
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:39,750
 The infravision is working. Heat is detected, hence there is life.

14
00:02:40,440 --> 00:02:42,540
 The heat could signify volcanoes.

15
00:02:42,950 --> 00:02:46,930
 I can't see any sign of volcanic eruption down there. I sense there is life there.

16
00:02:46,930 --> 00:02:50,390
 If I'm not mistaken, Lieutenant Piero is commander of the ship.

17
00:02:51,510 --> 00:02:54,070
 Okay, let's program a landing on this juicy little planet.

18
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:07,070
 6,000 meters and all is smooth as silk.

19
