 Climactic changes. The appearance of glaciers.

178
00:18:54,150 --> 00:19:01,230
 But the most probable explanation is a supernova explosion so near that its cosmic radiation killed most of life on the planet.

179
00:19:01,790 --> 00:19:04,130
 Statistically, it occurs every 60 million years.

180
